{c: Verse 1}
[D] Yun tera muskurana,        [D] aur aake chale jaana
[D] Yun tera muskurana,        [D] aur aake chale jaana
[G] Kismat ka hai [A] khul jaana,        [D] Tera, dee [G] dar hua
[A] Pehla, sa [G] pyaar hua,        [D] Pehli hi [G] baar hua [D] iss dil ko
[D] Naa toh [G] inkaar hua,        [A] Naa hi, [G] iqraar hua
[D] Jaane kya [G] yaar hua [D] iss dil ko,        [D] Yun tera muskurana....
[A] Tujhse mila toh jaagi [D] duaayein,        [G] Aur nazar ne [A] sajda kiya
